{"4198610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Fighter’s Nova: Mindara", "steam_appid": 4198610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/a2105d787f025ac914ff4b1295eef00c.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Fighter’s Nova: Mindara</strong></i> is a <strong>narrative-driven JRPG</strong> that fuses character-focused storytelling with the intensity and precision of a <strong>true tag-team fighting game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow <strong>Maya</strong>, a determined teenage martial artist searching for her own purpose, and <strong>Mindara</strong>, a mysterious wolf-man haunted by an unjust banishment and driven by revenge. Their journey leads them to a legendary tournament held within a hidden magical city—an arena where destiny, myth, and ambition collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they travel, you’ll meet a diverse cast of <strong>companions</strong>—each with their own motivations, backstories, combat styles and abilities. Through friendships, rivalries, and hard-earned trust, you’ll experience a <strong>classic JRPG-style adventure</strong> where growth, wisdom, and meaning are forged not just through dialogue, but through the art of battle itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b7e6df79a81db1e6e67ab57e90757df9.poster.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b7e6df79a81db1e6e67ab57e90757df9.webm?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b7e6df79a81db1e6e67ab57e90757df9.mp4?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/d85eda8350f29908cdc72b5016c5c46a.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter is a <strong>fully playable</strong> fighting game match, within a JRPG narrative experience. Battles unfold in real time with precise controls, advanced mechanics, and deep combo systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between</strong> characters mid-fight, chain abilities together, and discover devastating tag-team synergies. Each character brings their own fighting style, signature techniques, and ultimate abilities, allowing you to experiment with team compositions and strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your relationships matter:</strong> story choices and bonds between characters directly influence combat synergy, unlocking unique duo techniques and special moves. The stronger the bond, the more spectacular—and personal their combined attacks become, seamlessly blending narrative and combat into a single riveting experience.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/e1397e1a13c03af5464187bcb801435d.poster.avif?t=1783698051\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/e1397e1a13c03af5464187bcb801435d.webm?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/e1397e1a13c03af5464187bcb801435d.mp4?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/17d5c7a2f5c2d17f559619f4b80b1543.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the combat, <i><strong>A Fighter’s Nova: Mindara</strong></i> delivers a rich world filled with mysteries to uncover. Solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden paths, and discover secrets that reshape your understanding of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Maya rise as a true hero? Will Mindara find redemption, or be consumed by vengeance? <strong>The path is yours to forge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/37bbaaa8e7a8a16152ca55acc923649e.poster.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/37bbaaa8e7a8a16152ca55acc923649e.webm?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/37bbaaa8e7a8a16152ca55acc923649e.mp4?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b839cd63ce8c162ae02d6d1ee0f77880.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a true JRPG narrative adventure</strong> with <strong>explosive fighting mechanics</strong> and seamless transitions between story and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch heroes </strong>at any time with<strong> dynamic tag gameplay</strong>, choosing which companion to lead the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover unique skills</strong> for each hero to bring their own flair to the fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build bonds </strong>between characters to enhance combos and unlock new tactical options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feast your eyes on graphic manga cutscenes</strong> that enhance dialog and set your deepest emotions aflame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play to win or to be challenged </strong>with simplified controls for newcomers and advanced precision for seasoned players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play solo or with a friend in local co-op</strong>, with each player controlling a different character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/f80cd9da1bfd7545d8c3260d1c194d57.poster.avif?t=1783698051\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/f80cd9da1bfd7545d8c3260d1c194d57.webm?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/f80cd9da1bfd7545d8c3260d1c194d57.mp4?t=1783698051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/842cf89d78c50e3c27e14442bcdb2f21.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a newcomer or a seasoned player, <i>Mindara</i> offers an experience tailored to your level: simplified controls to enjoy the action without complexity, or a deeper system for those seeking precision and challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/a2105d787f025ac914ff4b1295eef00c.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1560 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>A Fighter’s Nova: Mindara</strong></i> is a <strong>narrative-driven JRPG</strong> that fuses character-focused storytelling with the intensity and precision of a <strong>true tag-team fighting game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You follow <strong>Maya</strong>, a determined teenage martial artist searching for her own purpose, and <strong>Mindara</strong>, a mysterious wolf-man haunted by an unjust banishment and driven by revenge. Their journey leads them to a legendary tournament held within a hidden magical city—an arena where destiny, myth, and ambition collide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they travel, you’ll meet a diverse cast of <strong>companions</strong>—each with their own motivations, backstories, combat styles and abilities. Through friendships, rivalries, and hard-earned trust, you’ll experience a <strong>classic JRPG-style adventure</strong> where growth, wisdom, and meaning are forged not just through dialogue, but through the art of battle itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b7e6df79a81db1e6e67ab57e90757df9.poster.avif?t=1783698051\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198610/extras/b7e6df79a81db1e6e67ab57e90757df9.webm?t=1783698051\" type=